{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/205467-how-much-do-spells-cost-witchfinders","id":205467,"title":"How much do spells cost? [Witchfinders]","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-22T17:47:19-07:00","id":205467,"title":"How much do spells cost? [Witchfinders]","content":"I'm playing a Gifted mortal, who has Gnosis 5 &amp; want to learn more spells but I can't find anywhere in the book how much spells cost, or the specific rules for buying them. Like how do I buy Evil Eye at level 4-5? &amp; How much would that cost? Would I have to buy Gaze of the Wise &amp; Mystic Shield first? Can anyone help?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2266-aermas","name":"Aermas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2266_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"128"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T20:45:26-07:00","id":205608,"title":"","content":"I don't think Gifted characters HAVE Gnosis. They just have single spells as Merits, and the spell's casting pool is [Attribute] + [Skill] + [Gifted Rating]. You buy each power as a separate merit. That means you can skip levels, but it also means things are more expensive for you.<br /> If you've got Gnosis, though, you might as well play a Mage character using the Hunter rules (Running a crossover game using only Hunter is my dream game). In which case spells are just Dread Powers, and you can learn them with Experience as if they were Endowment merits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T21:22:38-07:00","id":205634,"title":"","content":"Oops my bad. I just have Gnosis. Not the Gifted merit. We are not playing mage. It would break our Hunter game. I'm Gnosis 5 my ST let me start with 6 spells across 3 Mysteries. I want to add more spells &amp; don't know how much they would cost","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2266-aermas","name":"Aermas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2266_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"128"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-22T21:40:35-07:00","id":205643,"title":"","content":"Yeah, sounds like you're essentially playing a &quot;Witch&quot;, which is how Hunter handles Mages for groups that don't have (or don't want to deal with) Awakening. I'd say they'd cost the same as an Endowment, with each Mystery being treated as a separate Endowment. So each Mystery is 1-5 as normal for a Merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-23T23:00:44-07:00","id":206781,"title":"","content":"A while ago, the following was put up as 'cut' material<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> New Spell New dots x 3exp<br /> New Mystery 8 exp </div> </div> </div>That said, this was pre-GMC so if your group is using the update (and Mortal Remains) it'll need to be modifed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}